NOTE ON THE ANSWERS

Each week's raw data comes from public replies to a question posted on X.
It is published here so the analysis can be checked and reproduced. Handles
are kept only where they are needed to tell replies apart; no private
information is collected, and anyone who asks to have their reply removed
will have it removed from the files and the published results.